  "annotations": [
    {
      "id": "row-onboarding",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -150,
      "w": 560,
      "text": "FIRST TEN MINUTES\nTwo questions, then import what they already saved. The app is full before they ever see Home."
    },
    {
      "id": "row-app",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 850,
      "w": 560,
      "text": "THE APP — NO THUMBNAILS\nCategory icon + serif title + one meta line + a reason. The photo is kept on the save and reachable from the item screen, never shown in lists."
    },
    {
      "id": "row-more",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1850,
      "w": 700,
      "text": "NOTIFICATIONS · TRIPS · VOICE\nBell on Home opens 'For you'. Travel saves get a 'Plan this trip' offer pre-filled from the reels → day-wise plan, every stop credited to its reel. Voice: speak in Hindi/English/mixed → Whisper/Sarvam transcript → Claude pulls out who / where / about / remind-me and writes the document."
    },
    {
      "id": "note-data",
      "x": 1410,
      "y": 2000,
      "w": 380,
      "text": "WHERE EXPLORE / NEARBY DATA COMES FROM\n\n1. The user's own saves — always, from day one (GET /saves/nearby).\n2. Seeded places for the launch city — Place.source = 'seed' (GET /places/nearby).\n3. Other users' saves — Place.saveCount, shown only past a threshold (GET /places/trending).\n\nA row's reason line says which one it is. No LLM-generated places."
    },
    {
      "id": "note-palette",
      "x": 2820,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 300,
      "text": "Same tokens as the live app: teal #0E7C7B, DM Serif Display + Work Sans, mustard / brown / plum by category."
    }
  ],
